    "body": "The OpenEmbedded Layer meta-ros features\n- a general cross-compilation tool chain for catkin packages,\n- over 200 ROS packages, including all ros-base packages, ros-control, ros-controller, navigation and many more,\n- and recipes for roscpp_tutorials and common_tutorials as examples for your own tool chain.\n\nAll provided packages, except the ar_track_alvar and diagnostics packages, are the latest Hydro release versions, as defined in the hydro/distribution.yaml file [1] at commit 889e1f8c.\n\n[1] https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/889e1f8c1e431d3a26b8ab41cc0d6f154720d486/hydro/distribution.yaml\n"
